  "scope": "Complete countable Borel cover of the actual injective differentiability locus under continuity and lambda>1. Every piece has a genuine source automorphism and inverse, exact restricted inverse graph, both Lipschitz bounds, vector sandwich and Jacobian/determinant sandwich. Proved countable dense automorphism family, polar length model, radius selection, closed vector and remainder tests, Borel graph projection, small closed covers, and all piece estimates. Includes zero dimensions and applies erratum p. 4, book p. 242 line 23: O(n,m). Two regressions cover zero-source constant maps and the empty positive-source zero-target locus.",
